# Local-only Wrangler config for `wrangler pages dev` (D1/KV binding resolution).
# Deliberately NOT committed: this Pages project is git-integrated (Cloudflare
# builds from source, not from wrangler.toml), and Cloudflare Pages will start
# reading a committed wrangler.toml for its own config if one appears in the
# repo — that's a production-build risk we don't want. See PROJECT_STATE.md 第 27 轮.
wrangler.toml
.wrangler/

